  "content": "\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cmRWhN4.png\" alt=\"YUNG的桥梁\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\" /><br />\n<a title=\"依赖 YUNG's API\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"依赖 YUNG's API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\" /></a>&nbsp;<a title=\"加入 Discord 上的 YUNG 家族！\" href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入 Discord 上的 YUNG 家族！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\" /></a>&nbsp;<a title=\"在 Twitter 上关注我！\" href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"在 Twitter 上关注我！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\" /></a>&nbsp;<a title=\"订阅我的 YouTube！\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/yungnickyoung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"订阅我的 YouTube！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" /></a>&nbsp;<a title=\"在 Patreon 上支持我！\" href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\" /></a><br />\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ug8dC9A.png\" alt=\"这是什么？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\" /><br />\nYUNG's Bridges 是首款为游戏添加自然生成桥梁的 Minecraft 模组。探索世界，发现超过 15 种不同类型的桥梁，每种都拥有对应生物群系的专属变体！\n</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4aMS_7aq3ws\" title=\"YouTube视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ladFuIF.png\" alt=\"兼容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\" /><br />\nYUNG's Bridges 旨在与所有世界生成模组完全兼容，包括：\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's Better Desert Temples\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-desert-temples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Better Desert Temples</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-ocean-monuments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's Better Mineshafts\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-mineshafts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Better Mineshafts</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's Better Strongholds\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-strongholds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Better Strongholds</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's Extras\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Extras</a></li>\n<li>Oh the Biomes You'll Go</li>\n<li>Biomes O' Plenty</li>\n<li>Terralith：会使河流拥有更陡峭的河岸。桥梁仍可能生成，但会变得稀有。可尝试调高生成率。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a title=\"使用 Essential 模组与好友同乐！\" href=\"https://essential.gg/x/yung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"使用 Essential 模组与好友同乐！\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\" /><br />\n<a title=\"在 Bisect Hosting 使用代码 YUNGNICKYOUNG 享受服务器 25% 折扣！\" href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/yung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"在 Bisect Hosting 使用代码 YUNGNICKYOUNG 享受服务器 25% 折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\" /></a></p>",
